Enter s1 (s1.Enter).
Leave s1 (s1.Leave).
Enter s21 (s2.Enter).
Enter s21 (s21.Enter).
Leave s21 (s21.Leave).
Leave s21 (s2.Leave).
Enter Final (Final.Enter).
We're done.</StdOut>
